// Error: a four-rule cycle. Classically this even cycle has "solutions"
// (alternate rules existing), but they're ambiguous — which one you get
// depends on parse order — so it errors like any other circular prevention.
/*
{`/$`}{comment}{`$/`} =>
*/

/$
{`/#`}{comment}{`#/`} =>
$/

/#
{`/%`}{comment}{`%/`} =>
#/

/%
{`/*`}{comment}{`*/`} =>
%/
